  "bodyHash": "kmkJDXnt6b8=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=加入我们的Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism工具是Mekanism的官方附属模组，为各种Mekanism材料以及部分原版材料添加了工具和盔甲。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>为以下材料提供了盔甲、盾牌和工具（包括镐斧铲三合一工具）：</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青铜</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青金石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">锇</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">精制荧石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">精制黑曜石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">钢</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">此外还为原版工具类型添加了三合一工具：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">木</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">铁</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">金</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">钻石</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他Mekanism模块链接：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism附属</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism发电机</span></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>文档</strong>请查阅Mekanism的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方wiki</a>，由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a>托管！内容仍在完善中，欢迎贡献您的力量！</p><p><strong>源代码</strong>可在<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong>上获取！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>通过Patreon支持团队：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>通过Ko-fi支持团队：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>",
